--- !u!114 &1694407807
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1694407806}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 21372b81bd7c34737b05dcbb58ddb7d3, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::GmSceneCraftProfile
  sceneId: wend-hill
  artDirection: A present-day desperate arrival crosses a wet, historically layered
    rural estate toward one impossible warm house. Every zone must carry depth, ordinary
    human history and controlled negative space.
  deterministicSeed: 7
  zones:
  - zoneId: arrival
    visualThesis: The failed ordinary car is a low, muddy foreground fact; the estate
      gate and mansion pull beyond it.
    storyState: The driver arrived in haste and left the only plausible escape behind.
    focalElementId: arrival-car
    foregroundElementIds:
    - arrival-car
    - arrival-traces
    middleElementIds:
    - estate-gate
    - gate-plaque
    backgroundElementIds:
    - drive-tree-lines
    - mansion-shell
    maximumEmptyGroundShare: 0.42
    maximumRepeatedSilhouetteRun: 3
  - zoneId: drive
    visualThesis: A crowned wet route compresses between irregular boundaries before
      releasing at the house.
    storyState: Wheels used this road recently, but maintenance stopped long ago.
    focalElementId: mansion-shell
    foregroundElementIds:
    - drive-route
    - drive-edge-litter
    middleElementIds:
    - drive-fence
    - drive-tree-lines
    backgroundElementIds:
    - middle-acreage
    - mansion-shell
    maximumEmptyGroundShare: 0.44
    maximumRepeatedSilhouetteRun: 3
  - zoneId: cemetery
    visualThesis: Historical family groups surround one fresh excavation while a
      modest chapel closes the side view.
    storyState: Burial accumulated over generations; one unnamed grave was prepared
      recently.
    focalElementId: open-grave
    foregroundElementIds:
    - cemetery-wall
    - cemetery-entry-path
    middleElementIds:
    - stag-plinth
    - open-grave
    - cemetery-grave-01
    backgroundElementIds:
    - chapel-building
    maximumEmptyGroundShare: 0.4
    maximumRepeatedSilhouetteRun: 2
  - zoneId: garden
    visualThesis: Broken dead cultivation joins the well, scarecrow and shed into
      one stopped task.
    storyState: A productive kitchen garden was abandoned suddenly and never resumed.
    focalElementId: garden-scarecrow
    foregroundElementIds:
    - garden-entry-path
    - garden-row-traces
    middleElementIds:
    - garden-basin
    - garden-bed-anchor
    - garden-work-debris
    backgroundElementIds:
    - garden-shed
    maximumEmptyGroundShare: 0.38
    maximumRepeatedSilhouetteRun: 3
  - zoneId: acreage
    visualThesis: Low hedgerow masses and field remnants bridge the playable estate
      to a fog-separated irregular horizon.
    storyState: The grounds extend beyond the route as former working land, not empty
      world space.
    focalElementId: middle-acreage
    foregroundElementIds:
    - flank-groundcover
    middleElementIds:
    - middle-acreage
    backgroundElementIds:
    - distant-woodland
    - north-ridge
    - south-ridge
    maximumEmptyGroundShare: 0.48
    maximumRepeatedSilhouetteRun: 3
  - zoneId: mansion
    visualThesis: One mansion owns the terminal axis; its threshold is inviting in
      light and absolute in behavior.
    storyState: The house expected this visitor and refuses entry until the count
      is complete.
    focalElementId: mansion-shell
    foregroundElementIds:
    - drive-route
    middleElementIds:
    - porch-threshold-anchor
    backgroundElementIds:
    - mansion-shell
    - window-figure
    maximumEmptyGroundShare: 0.36
    maximumRepeatedSilhouetteRun: 3
